## No distribution mode for containerized deployments
## This vm.args is used when RELEASE_DISTRIBUTION=none

## Enable SMP
+S 4:4

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
+Q 65536

## Increase process count
+P 1000000

## Enable kernel poll
+K true

## Use async threads
+A 64

## Garbage collection
+hms 233

## Allocator settings for memory efficiency
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512
+MEas aobf
